I’ve got enough evidence to write the lane verdicts: one wrong-population STEP 8 record, three duplicate/secondary SELECT publications, and one registry-only SELECT record. I’m writing the JSON and report now, with validation inside the same command so the report’s command log stays closed over what was actually run.
